# Atlantis 12 — environment variables
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in real values, or set the same
# variables in the Vercel project's Environment Variables panel.

# Google Maps JavaScript API key, restricted to the production domain.
# Used by src/components/Home/ReviewsSection.jsx to fetch live Google reviews
# and the aggregate rating for Atlantis 12 (Place ID ChIJz4yJ76SaDBkRKk9cbaQh9Fc).
# If absent, the site falls back to the hard-coded 4.8 / 48 reviews values.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
